<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Bukti antarlembaga #<?= (int)$row['id']; ?></title><style>body{font:13px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;max-width:950px;margin:32px auto;padding:16px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{border:1px solid #bbb;padding:8px;text-align:left}tr{break-inside:avoid}.sign{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-top:40px}.sign p{margin-top:65px}@media print{button{display:none}@page{size:A4;margin:15mm}}</style></head><body><button onclick="window.print()">Cetak / simpan PDF</button><h1>Bukti Peminjaman dan Serah-Terima Antarlembaga</h1><p>Transaksi #<?= (int)$row['id']; ?> · <?= html_escape($labels[$row['state']]); ?></p><p><strong>Pemilik:</strong> <?= html_escape($row['owner_name']); ?><br><strong>Peminjam:</strong> <?= html_escape($row['borrower_name']); ?><br><strong>Koleksi:</strong> <?= html_escape($row['title'].' · '.$row['barcode']); ?><br><strong>Jatuh tempo:</strong> <?= html_escape($row['due_on']); ?></p><p>Kepemilikan tidak berpindah. Cetakan ini merekam status saat dicetak, bukan tanda tangan elektronik. Jika belum ada penerimaan, cetakan bukan bukti bahwa barang telah diterima.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Waktu</th><th>Pihak / akun</th><th>Tindakan</th><th>Catatan</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($events as $e): ?><tr><td><?= html_escape($e['created_at']); ?></td><td><?= html_escape($e['library_name']); ?> (#<?= (int)$e['actor_id']; ?>)</td><td><?= html_escape($e['action']); ?></td><td><?= nl2br(html_escape($e['note'])); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table><div class="sign"><div>Petugas perpustakaan pemilik<p>(______________________)</p></div><div>Petugas perpustakaan peminjam<p>(______________________)</p></div></div></body></html>
